      own _sample_task since it composes sibling tasks into a MultiTask.
    - MultiTask.__init__ now calls super().__init__ instead of re-deriving all
      22 base fields by hand (verified field-for-field parity), so it picks up
      whatever the base adds later.
    - BaseMujocoTask gains _on_episode_configured(), a hook for state derived
      from the config or scene; NavToObjTask and PickAndPlaceTask move their
      constructor-time caches onto it. Note it runs from super().__init__, so
      subclasses needing attributes during it must set them beforehand.
    
