    * tasks: extract BaseMujocoTask._bind_env
    
    Loading a scene closes the sim env and builds a new CPUMujocoEnv around the
    newly compiled model (BaseMujocoTaskSampler.update_scene), and a task's
    _n_sim_steps_per_ctrl is derived from env.mj_model.opt.timestep. So a task
    that outlives a scene change cannot keep its original env: it has to re-bind
    and re-derive the step ratios, or it would step a closed env with the
    previous model's ratio.
    
    Pure extraction from __init__ for now; reset() will call it once tasks
    configure themselves.
    
