    * tasks: make BaseMujocoTask a gymnasium.Env that can configure itself
    
    BaseMujocoTask now subclasses gymnasium.Env, and a task can build its own
    episode instead of being built by a sampler:
    
        task = PickAndPlaceTask(exp_config=cfg, configure=True)   # gym path
        task = PickAndPlaceTask(sim_env, cfg)                     # unchanged
    
    Self-configuration needs more than _configure_episode: house iteration,
    scene load/reuse, scene randomization, the mj_forward sync and the metadata
    flush all lived inside sample_task above task construction. Split those out
    so both paths run the same sampler steps in the same order:
    
      prepare_episode()  -> scene ready for one episode, False if out of tasks
      _sample_task()     -> configure + construct + _post_construct (unchanged)
      finalize_episode() -> camera pose refresh + log
    
    sample_task() is now prepare -> _sample_task -> finalize.
    
